# Review Rust changes — "safely"

**Stack:** Rust

## Context

Refer to these files for background:

- `./README.md`

## Instructions

- Never touch `unsafe` blocks **(REQUIRED)**
- When working in `src/ui/**`: WCAG 2.1 AA **(REQUIRED)**
- Prefer small diffs *(preferred)*
- Adding a dependency **(ASK FIRST)**

## Protected Files

- `src/auth/**`: security reviewed

## Assumptions

- [x] CI is green

## Deliverable

A review comment per finding.
Each names a file and a line.
